title: When a plan removes a refusal, ask what else that refusal prevented
pid: 16e43bc7-e2b4-420e-a202-bd277d2ccac4
body: |2-
  A refusal often does a second job nobody wrote down. Plan 4 stopped
  the dirty-view check from matching through links, so a save a dirty
  view had blocked went through; but that block was also what kept
  the save from redrawing the dirty view, and the redraw would have
  discarded its edits. Before removing a refusal, list the saves (or
  requests) it was stopping and follow each through the pipeline
  without it.
